description:
Rule 5 — frontend-ui

Purpose: Construire UI réutilisable (React + Tailwind + shadcn/ui), accessible et responsive.
Trigger: nouvelle feature UI / refonte composant.
Inputs: user story + maquettes éventuelles.
Output (repo + Notion):

Composant React (states: default/hover/active/focus/disabled)

Screenshots 1440/768/375

Doc composant (props, usage, variantes)

Steps

Lister composants requis.

Tenter d’abord shadcn/ui (extend si besoin).

Implémenter avec grille 8px (Tailwind).

Tester 3 viewports (pas de scroll horizontal).

Audit a11y (contrast, tab order, aria).

Doc + exemples d’usage.

Do: tokens cohérents, dark mode accessible.
Don’t: magic numbers, variations incohérentes.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
